# UNVERIFIED — pending debrief
#
# The one `certain` fix in M-literal-bases, alone in its own file because
# `--apply` must leave a program that checks clean (CLAUDE.md §8), and a file
# whose other diagnostics carry no fix could not show that.
#
# The fix is `certain` and not a guess, which is the whole difference from
# `leading-zero.hero` next door: `0X10` has exactly one reading, so lowering the
# prefix cannot change what the author meant. `0700` has two, so its fixes are
# both `guess` and `--apply` leaves it alone.

function main()
    mask = 0xFF   #~ base_prefix_case
    print(mask)
